privacy.s4.p:
{site} only uses cookies that are strictly necessary for it to work, which do not require consent:
• a session cookie (“gl_session”, 30 days), which keeps you logged in;
• a security cookie (“gl_csrf”, 1 year), which protects the forms;
• a message cookie (“gl_flash”, a few moments), which shows a confirmation after an action.

There is no advertising cookie and no third-party audience measurement tool. If such a tool were added, this page would be updated and your agreement would be asked for when the law requires it.
